Get redirection URL for a Databricks resource by looking up the opportunity.

Looks up the opportunity in ClickHouse and returns the appropriate URL
based on the resource type:
- 12: CLUSTER -> /clusters/{resource_id}
- 17: JOB -> /jobs/{resource_id}
- 18: DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE (SQL warehouse) -> /sql-warehouses/{resource_id}
